s / Labels:  \n- McAfee Interface Labels: “保护您的 PC” (Protect Your PC), “运行扫描” (Run Scan), “实时扫描” (Real-Time Scan), “计划的扫描” (Scheduled Scan), “隔离的项目” (Quarantined Items), “防火墙” (Firewall), “保护应用程序” (Protect Applications), “保护您上网无忧” (Protect You Online), “浏览器安全” (Browser Security), “跟踪器删除程序” (Tracker Removal Program); Buttons: “开启” (On), “关闭” (Close), “移除” (Remove), “添加文件” (Add File).  \n- Windows Control Panel Labels: “卸载或更改程序” (Uninstall or Change Programs); Columns: “名称” (Name), “发布者” (Publisher), “安装时间” (Installation Time), “大小” (Size), “版本” (Version).  \n\nData Points:  \n- McAfee Real-Time Scan: Excluded file “CSIIIPowerService.exe” located at “C:\\Program Files (x86)\\CSIIIPowerService”.  \n- Windows Control Panel Installed Programs: Npcap (Nmap Project, 2022/11/21), ToDesk (ToDesk Remote Desktop, 2023/2/6), Update for Windows 10 (Microsoft Corporation, 2022/11/3), VMProtect Ultimate v2.1 (VMProtect Software, 2022/12/27), VMware Tools (VMware, Inc., 2023/2/28), Wireshark 3.4.5 64-bit (The Wireshark developer community, 2022/11/21), WPS Office (Kingsoft Corp., 2023/5/24), 安全服务 (unknown publisher, 2023/6/12).  \n\nTrends / Insights:  \n- McAfee real-time scanning is enabled (“实时扫描: 开”), indicating active protection against malware.  \n- The excluded files section allows users to specify trusted files to skip scans, reducing false positives for known-safe applications.  \n- The Windows control panel lists various installed programs, including security-related tools (e.g., VMProtect, Wireshark) and productivity software (e.g., WPS Office).  \n\nCaptions / Annotations:  \n- McAfee Note: “实时扫描会在您每次使用文件时，持续保护您的 PC 免受病毒和其他恶意软件的伤害，所以最好将该功能保持打开状态。” (Real-time scanning protects your PC from viruses and other malicious software every time you use a file, so it’s best to keep this feature turned on.)  \n- Exclusion Policy Note: “如果不希望我们扫描某些文件，请将其添加到这里。但请注意，这些被排除的文件不会进行病毒或其他恶意软件检查，可能会严重伤害您的 PC。如果排除的文件发生任何更改，我们会将其移出排除列表。如果您确定此文件安全，可将其重新添加至排除列表。” (If you don’t want us to scan certain files, add them here. But please note, these excluded files will not be checked for viruses or other malicious software, which may seriously harm your PC. If the excluded file changes in any way, we will remove it from the exclusion list. If you confirm this file is safe, you can re-add it to the exclusion list.)常见问题\n（五）登录相关问题\n问题十：嘉兴银行官网打不开\n\n近期，遇到多位企业客户来电反映嘉兴银行官网打不开，需客户提供IP，科技核实确认IP被封的话，反馈客户经理，按内网“关于出现企业客户无法访问我行网银系统的通知”执行（详见内网通知http://nw.jx/cms/1/5891/69949.html）（2023-11-15）。——客户提供的互联网IP先让科技部查看下是否被封了。\n\n\n再尝试排除扫描“csiipowerservice”安全服务（也可尝试“关闭实时扫描”、“退出杀毒软件”、“卸载杀毒软件”等方法），然后重新安装“CSIIPowerService_Setup.exe”\n\n\n\n\n4、安装包文件CSIIPowerService_Setup.exe\n上述白名单添加之后，用户可直接安装此文件重新修复操作，\n\n或者在控制面板中找到“安全服务”右键点击卸载之后，重新通过助手检测修复。\n\n\n\n   📄 来源: 新电子渠道（企业）2024.10.docx ([⬇️ 下载](/api/v1/assets/proxy/ragflow/doc/a928cea6e93811f08ba7712b5dc403b8?name=%E6%96%B0%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%B8%A0%E9%81%93%EF%BC%88%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%EF%BC%892024.10.docx)) | 相关度: 27.01%\n   相关图片: [IMG-4]\n\n【5】包括且不限于：项目部署方案、应急与回退方案、投产验证方案，\n有数据迁移的还应有数据迁移投产方案（含数据库备份、清理、\n转储操作）等。\n   📄 来源: 嘉兴银行信息系统上线投产流程 v1.0.pdf ([⬇️ 下载](/api/v1/assets/proxy/ragflow/doc/b5556598e93611f08e41712b5dc403b8?name=%E5%98%89%E5%85%B4%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%BF%E6%8A%95%E4%BA%A7%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%20v1.0.pdf)) | 相关度: 26.71%\n   相关图片: [IMG-5]\n\n【6】\n- Visual Type: User Interface Screenshot (composite of multiple UI elements)\n- Title: 嘉兴银行 | 网银助手\n- Axes / Legends / Labels:  \n  - Top navigation icons with labels: “检测修复”, “快捷链接”, “安全提示”, “软件设置”  \n  - Main status message: “您的电脑达到了使用网银的要求！”  \n  - Highlighted button label: “一键修复” (enclosed in a red box)  \n  - Subsection labels: “系统环境”, “浏览器设置”  \n  - System environment items (each with a green checkmark):  \n    - “[操作系统]Windows 10 64-bit”  \n    - “[当前用户]admin”  \n    - “[本地时间]本地时间准确”  \n    - “[证书链]证书链完整”  \n  - Browser setting item (with a green checkmark): “[IE浏览器]11.1.22000.0”  \n  - USB key pop-up text: “请在USBKey按键确认或取消操作”  \n  - Browser tab URL: “https://emobile.bojx.com/ENTWEB/”  \n  - Browser warning message: “你的连接不是专用连接”  \n- Data Points:  \n  - System environment: All listed items (OS, user, time, certificate chain) have green checkmarks, indicating compliance with online banking requirements.  \n  - Browser setting: IE version 11.1.22000.0 is marked as compliant (green checkmark).  \n- Trends / Insights:  \n  The system meets all basic technical requirements for using the online banking service (evidenced by green checkmarks in “系统环境” and “浏览器设置”). However, the browser displays a security warning (“你的连接不是专用连接”), suggesting a potential risk despite system compliance.  \n- Captions / Annotations:  \n  - Red box around “一键修复”: Highlights a primary action button for users to initiate repairs, even though system requirements are met.  \n  - USB key pop-up: A modal dialog prompting user interaction with a physical USB key for authentication, a common security measure in banking systems.  \n  - Browser warning: An alert indicating the connection is not secure, which is a critical security note that may override system compliance for safe usage.嘉兴银行企业网银（试运行）登录操作指南\n环境准备\n\n1.1驱动下载/升级\n插入UKEY后关闭所有浏览器，打开网银助手进行一键修复，修复完毕后建议重启电脑，进行新版企业网银、企业客户端的使用。若网银助手提示更新，请点击是进行更新。\n\n\n支持所有浏览器型号，建议使用谷歌、360、IE、Chrome等，也可在常用办公电脑上下载网银客户端，更加方便快捷。\n1.2问题排查（上述无法解决）：\n驱动版本确认\n此次系统升级，U盾的驱动也进行了升级，有时会出现网银助手驱动升级失败的情况，需要手动删除老版本U盾驱动，并阻止自动安装老版本U盾驱动。\n如何确认是否为老版本U盾驱动：\n①请在右下角找到管理工具：，如果插入U盾显示老嘉兴银行LOGO，则为老驱动。\n②在制单或者复核时弹出的页面不是这样的，则为老驱动。\n③如何修复：打开控制面板-程序-卸载程序\n\n将上图2个嘉兴银行USBKEY管理工具均删除，再参照1.1驱动下载/升级指南操作。\n\n你的连接不是专用连接\n\n该问题记录下转技术部门处理。\n\n   📄 来源: 新电子渠道（企业）2024.10.docx ([⬇️ 下载](/api/v1/assets/proxy/ragflow/doc/a928cea6e93811f08ba7712b5dc403b8?name=%E6%96%B0%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%B8%A0%E9%81%93%EF%BC%88%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%EF%BC%892024.10.docx)) | 相关度: 25.81%\n   相关图片: [IMG-6]\n\n【7】（二）《嘉兴银行信息系统项目文档清单-XXX 系统》文档应\n符合项目裁剪表中文档种类。（有模板）\n   📄 来源: 嘉兴银行信息系统上线投产流程 v1.0.pdf ([⬇️ 下载](/api/v1/assets/proxy/ragflow/doc/b5556598e93611f08e41712b5dc403