ar boxes): "申请人提出", "开发中心分管负责人", "运行维护中心分管负责人", "操作系统管理人员", "中间件管理人员", "数据库管理人员", "网络管理人员", "科技管理中心安全管理人员", "科技运行维护分管负责人", "项目经理确认", "申请人办结". No axes or legends are present.  \n- Data Points: The flowchart depicts a sequential process with the following steps and connections:  \n  1. Start: 申请人提出 (Applicant submits request)  \n  2. Next: 开发中心分管负责人 (Development Center Manager)  \n  3. Next: 运行维护中心分管负责人 (Operation and Maintenance Center Manager)  \n  4. Parallel steps from 运行维护中心分管负责人:  \n     - Left: 操作系统管理人员 (Operating System Manager)  \n     - Middle-left: 中间件管理人员 (Middleware Manager)  \n     - Middle-right: 数据库管理人员 (Database Manager)  \n     - Right: 网络管理人员 (Network Manager)  \n  5. Next: 科技管理中心安全管理人员 (Technology Management Center Security Manager)  \n  6. Next: 科技运行维护分管负责人 (Technology Operation and Maintenance Manager)  \n  7. Next: 项目经理确认 (Project Manager Approval)  \n  8. End: 申请人办结 (Applicant completes the process)  \n- Trends / Insights: The flowchart illustrates a hierarchical, multi-stage workflow with both linear and parallel components. Key insights include:  \n  - Linear progression from applicant submission through managerial and specialist roles.  \n  - Parallel processing at the 运行维护中心分管负责人 stage, where four technical teams (OS, middleware, database, network) handle tasks concurrently.  \n  - Consolidation of parallel tasks into a security review (科技管理中心安全管理人员) before advancing to subsequent approvals.  \n  - Final approval by the project manager concludes the process for the applicant.  \n- Captions / Annotations: No captions or annotations are present beyond the node labels.申请人提出\n开发中心分管负责\n人\n运行维护中心分管\n负责人\n操作系统管理人员\n中间件管理人员\n数据库管理人员\n网络管理人员\n科技管理中心安全\n管理人员\n科技运行维护分管\n负责人\n项目经理确认\n申请人办结\n*申请人办结后，需存PDF电子稿并打印后归入项目文档；\n*流程附件为评审报告（扫描件）\n   📄 来源: 嘉兴银行信息系统上线投产流程 v1.0.pdf ([⬇️ 下载](/api/v1/assets/proxy/ragflow/doc/b5556598e93611f08e41712b5dc403b8?name=%E5%98%89%E5%85%B4%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%BF%E6%8A%95%E4%BA%A7%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%20v1.0.pdf)) | 相关度: 22.64%\n   相关图片: [IMG-15]\n\n【16】二、评审组成员及要求\n项目经理、项目组成员、质量管理人员、安全管理人员、网\n络管理人员、运行维护中心负责人、科技信息部分管负责人、项\n目牵头部门分管负责人和项目配合部门分管负责人。\n评审需要明确人员和评审内容，并由各评审人员签字确认；评\n审未通过，应根据未通过原因进行整改，再次评审。\n   📄 来源: 嘉兴银行信息系统上线投产流程 v1.0.pdf ([⬇️ 下载](/api/v1/assets/proxy/ragflow/doc/b5556598e93611f08e41712b5dc403b8?name=%E5%98%89%E5%85%B4%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%BF%E6%8A%95%E4%BA%A7%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%20v1.0.pdf)) | 相关度: 22.53%\n   相关图片: [IMG-16]\n\n【17】六、OA审批流程：上线投产OA审批流程（由项目经理提起）\n\n- Visual Type: Flowchart  \n- Title: None (explicitly provided)  \n- Axes / Legends / Labels:  \n  - Start node: "项目经理提出上线投产审批申请"  \n  - Decision node 1: "软件开发中心负责人" (outgoing arrows to):  \n    - "科技信息部开发分管负责人"  \n    - "科技信息部运行分管负责人"  \n    - "项目牵头部门负责人"  \n    - "项目配合部门负责人"  \n    - "风险管理部负责人" (annotated with "重要系统、互联网业务系统")  \n  - Decision node 2: "科技信息部负责人" (outgoing arrows to):  \n    - "业务分管行领导"  \n    - "科技分管行领导"  \n  - End node: "项目经理办结"  \n- Data Points: Not applicable (flowchart represents a process, not quantitative data)  \n- Trends / Insights: The flowchart outlines a structured approval workflow for project go-live. Critical steps include initial submission by the project manager, review by the software development center head (who directs tasks to specialized departments, including risk management for high-priority systems), subsequent review by the technology information department head, and final sign-off by business and technology leadership before project closure.  \n- Captions / Annotations: The annotation "重要系统、互联网业务系统" specifies that these categories of projects require engagement of the risk management department during the approval process.项目经理提出上线\n投产审批申请\n软件开发中心\n负责人\n重要系统、互联网业务系统\n科技信息部开发分\n科技信息部运行分\n项目牵头部门负责\n项目配合部门负责\n风险管理部门负责\n管负责人\n管负责人\n人\n人\n人\n科技信息部负\n责人\n业务分管行领导\n科技分管行领导\n项目经理办结\n*项目经理应保存PDF电子稿并打印后归入项目文档；\n*上线投产审批附件包括：上线投产评审报告（扫描件，PDF\n格式）和《嘉兴银行信息系统投产同意书-XXX 系统》（有模板）；\n   📄 来源: 嘉兴银行信息系统上线投产流程 